Investigate a query collection stuck in an empty state

Async cleanup cancels a newly started sync, leaving the collection empty. The old cleanup can cancel the new sync's work, preventing the collection from filling. The old cleanup cancels the restarted fetch, leaving the collection with no data. Previous cleanup can cancel newly scheduled work, preventing data delivery.

